<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#070b14">
<meta name="description" content="INVISIBLE THREAD — mapping potential healthcare infrastructure dependencies across Andhra Pradesh.">
<title>INVISIBLE THREAD | Infrastructure Intelligence</title>
<style>
:root {
  color-scheme: dark;
  --bg:#070b14; --panel:#101827; --line:#26364b;
  --muted:#91a4bd; --text:#edf5ff; --cyan:#51d9f5;
  --pink:#ff719b; --amber:#ffc66d;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{margin:0;background:var(--bg);color:var(--text);
font-family:Inter,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
button,a{-webkit-tap-highlight-color:transparent}
nav{height:76px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
padding:0 6%;border-bottom:1px solid #26364b;background:#080e19;
position:sticky;top:0;z-index:10}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
.logo{width:40px;height:40px;border:1px solid var(--cyan);border-radius:12px;
display:grid;place-items:center;color:var(--cyan);font-weight:900;
box-shadow:0 0 24px #51d9f522}
.brand strong{font-size:13px;letter-spacing:2px}
.brand small{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;margin-top:5px}
.links{display:flex;gap:25px;align-items:center;font-size:12px;color:#b5c5d9}
.links a:hover{color:var(--cyan)}
.links .active{color:var(--cyan)}
.nav-cta,.primary{background:var(--cyan);color:#07101b;font-weight:800;
border-radius:9px;padding:12px 17px;display:inline-flex;align-items:center;
justify-content:center;font-size:12px;transition:.2s}
.nav-cta:hover,.primary:hover{transform:translateY(-2px);box-shadow:0 8px 30px #51d9f533}
.hero{position:relative;overflow:hidden;min-height:650px;padding:100px 7% 85px;
display:flex;align-items:center;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.hero:before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;
background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 77% 45%,#153b5866 0,transparent 42%),
radial-gradient(ellipse at 14% 85%,#a52b5c16 0,transparent 40%)}
.grid-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;opacity:.22;pointer-events:none;
background-image:linear-gradient(#53718b20 1px,transparent 1px),
linear-gradient(90deg,#53718b20 1px,transparent 1px);
background-size:58px 58px;mask-image:linear-gradient(to right,transparent,#000)}
.hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:1;max-width:790px}
.eyebrow{color:var(--cyan);font-size:10px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:3px;
text-transform:uppercase;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
.pulse{height:7px;width:7px;background:var(--cyan);border-radius:50%;
box-shadow:0 0 15px var(--cyan)}
h1{font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,88px);line-height:1.02;letter-spacing:-3px;
margin:26px 0 22px;font-weight:850}
h1 span{color:var(--cyan)}
.lead{font-size:16px;line-height:1.9;color:#a8bad0;max-width:640px}
.actions{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:32px}
.secondary{border:1px solid #3a4b60;padding:12px 17px;border-radius:9px;
font-size:12px;font-weight:700;background:#10182788}
.secondary:hover{border-color:var(--cyan)}
.hero-note{font-size:10px;color:#7187a1;margin-top:26px;letter-spacing:.4px}
.orbit{position:absolute;right:5%;top:18%;width:min(35vw,390px);aspect-ratio:1;
border:1px solid #51d9f52c;border-radius:50%;pointer-events:none}
.orbit:before,.orbit:after{content:"";position:absolute;border:1px solid #51d9f51c;
border-radius:50%;inset:12%}
.orbit:after{inset:25%;border-color:#ff719b35}
.orbit-core{position:absolute;inset:36%;border-radius:50%;
background:radial-gradient(circle,#51d9f577,#51d9f508 70%);
box-shadow:0 0 70px #51d9f52b}
.node{position:absolute;width:9px;height:9px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--cyan);
box-shadow:0 0 18px currentColor}
.n1{top:14%;left:28%}.n2{top:42%;right:8%;background:var(--pink);color:var(--pink)}
.n3{bottom:18%;left:23%;background:var(--amber);color:var(--amber)}
.n4{top:24%;right:27%;width:5px;height:5px}
.metrics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
background:#0a111d}
.metric{padding:27px 6%;border-right:1px solid var(--line)}
.metric:last-child{border-right:0}
.metric strong{display:block;font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,34px);letter-spacing:-1px}
.metric span{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:10px;line-height:1.7;margin-top:8px}
.section{padding:85px 7%}
.section-head{max-width:670px;margin-bottom:35px}
.kicker{font-size:10px;color:var(--pink);letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:800}
h2{font-size:clamp(28px,4vw,43px);letter-spacing:-1.4px;margin:13px 0}
.section-head p{font-size:13px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.9}
.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:16px}
.card{padding:25px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:15px;
background:linear-gradient(145deg,#111c2c,#0b111c);min-height:205px}
.card .num{font-size:11px;color:var(--cyan);letter-spacing:2px}
.card h3{font-size:17px;margin:25px 0 10px}
.card p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;color:var(--muted);margin:0}
.callout{border:1px solid #51d9f536;border-radius:18px;padding:35px;
background:radial-gradient(ellipse at 100% 0,#51d9f515,transparent 60%),#0d1725;
display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:25px}
.callout h2{font-size:clamp(24px,3vw,36px);margin-top:0}
.callout p{color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;line-height:1.8;max-width:600px}
footer{padding:25px 7%;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;
justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap;color:#7f93ad;font-size:10px}
footer strong{letter-spacing:1.5px;color:#dce9f8}
@media(max-width:800px){
 .links{gap:12px}.links a:not(.nav-cta){display:none}
 .hero{min-height:590px;padding:75px 7%}
 .orbit{right:-18%;top:12%;width:65vw;opacity:.6}
 .hero-inner{max-width:100%}
 .metrics{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}
 .metric:nth-child(2){border-right:0}
 .metric:nth-child(-n+2){border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
 .cards{grid-template-columns:1fr}
 .card{min-height:0}
 .callout{align-items:flex-start;flex-direction:column}
 h1{letter-spacing:-2px}
}
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){html{scroll-behavior:auto}*{transition:none!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<nav>
  <a class="brand" href="index.html">
    <span class="logo">IT</span>
    <span><strong>INVISIBLE THREAD</strong><small>INFRASTRUCTURE INTELLIGENCE</small></span>
  </a>
  <div class="links">
    <a class="active" href="index.html">Home</a>
    <a href="explorer.html">Explorer</a>
    <a href="simulator.html">Simulator</a>
    <a href="insights.html">Insights</a>
    <a href="about.html">About</a>
    <a class="nav-cta" href="explorer.html">Launch Explorer ↗</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<main>
<section class="hero">
  <div class="grid-bg"></div>
  <div class="orbit"><div class="orbit-core"></div><i class="node n1"></i>
    <i class="node n2"></i><i class="node n3"></i><i class="node n4"></i></div>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="eyebrow"><i class="pulse"></i> Healthcare infrastructure · Andhra Pradesh</div>
    <h1>See the system.<br>Find the <span>invisible</span><br>connections.</h1>
    <p class="lead">Healthcare facilities do not operate in isolation. INVISIBLE THREAD explores the spatial relationships between hospitals and pharmacies, helping reveal potential proximity-based dependencies and investigate what disruption could mean for a connected network.</p>
    <div class="actions">
      <a class="primary" href="explorer.html">Explore the network &nbsp; ↗</a>
      <a class="secondary" href="about.html">Understand the methodology</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-note">SPATIAL DATA · NETWORK EXPLORATION · WHAT-IF ANALYSIS</div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="metrics" aria-label="Dataset summary">
  <div class="metric"><strong>2,978</strong><span>FACILITY RECORDS IN THE CURRENT DATASET</span></div>
  <div class="metric"><strong>26</strong><span>APPROXIMATE CITY-CENTRED SEARCH AREAS</span></div>
  <div class="metric"><strong>5,031</strong><span>PROXIMITY CANDIDATE LINKS</span></div>
  <div class="metric"><strong>3 km</strong><span>HOSPITAL–PHARMACY CANDIDATE SEARCH DISTANCE</span></div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="section-head">
    <div class="kicker">THE PLATFORM</div>
    <h2>One network. Five ways to explore it.</h2>
    <p>Move from a geographic overview to facility-level exploration, simulated disruptions, regional patterns, and a transparent account of how the data was assembled.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="cards">
    <article class="card"><div class="num">01 / EXPLORE</div><h3>Network Explorer</h3><p>Search facilities, filter by region or category, and inspect mapped locations and proximity-candidate connections.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><div class="num">02 / TEST</div><h3>Disruption Simulator</h3><p>Run a what-if scenario for a selected facility and inspect nearby candidate relationships. Results are exploratory, not predictions of real-world harm.</p></article>
    <article class="card"><div class="num">03 / UNDERSTAND</div><h3>Insights & Analytics</h3><p>Compare the current dataset across areas, examine category counts, and identify where the collected records have coverage gaps.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section" style="padding-top:0">
  <div class="callout">
    <div><div class="kicker">START INVESTIGATING</div><h2>Every connection begins with a question.</h2>
      <p>Explore the mapped facilities and candidate links. A nearby pharmacy is a spatial candidate, not proof of a verified supplier relationship.</p></div>
    <a class="primary" href="explorer.html">Open Network Explorer ↗</a>
  </div>
</section>
</main>

<footer>
  <strong>INVISIBLE THREAD</strong>
  <span>Spatial infrastructure intelligence · Andhra Pradesh</span>
  <span>Research prototype · Candidate links are not verified dependencies</span>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
